WEBVTT

00:00:03.246 --> 00:00:04.863
Run the report.

00:00:04.863 --> 00:00:11.174
The Export menu offers Export CSV, Export Excel and Export PDF, depending on

00:00:11.174 --> 00:00:13.561
the features that are on:

00:00:13.561 --> 00:00:19.256
Reports for CSV, Reports OpenXml for Excel, and Reports PDF for PDF.

00:00:19.713 --> 00:00:21.275
Click Export PDF.

00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:26.913
The export uses the filters on screen, so the file shows what the page shows.

00:00:28.513 --> 00:00:32.216
The PDF lays the report out as it looks on the page:

00:00:32.216 --> 00:00:38.283
a band for each container, tables with their totals, charts as drawn, and numbered pages.

